{
  "_id": "index-obedience",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Nephi1 obeys voice of the Spirit, 1 Ne. 4:18. if ye are obedient to commandments, ye shall be saved, 1 Ne. 22:31. the Lamb witnesses that he would be obedient in keeping commandments, 2 Ne. 31:7. thus hath the Lord commanded me, and I must obey, 2 Ne. 33:15. Enos2 promises obedience unto commands, Jacob 7:27. he who listeth to obey evil spirit receiveth for wages everlasting punishment, Mosiah 2:32–33, 37. all who have entered covenant to be obedient take upon themselves name of Christ, Mosiah 5:8. he who does not obey iniquitous king is destroyed, Mosiah 29:23. men reap their reward according to spirit they list to obey, Alma 3:26–27. Ammonite youth obey every command with exactness, Alma 57:21.",
